## Ignore Visual Studio temporary files, build results, and
## files generated by popular Visual Studio add-ons.

# Build Folders
**/bin/
**/obj/

# User-specific files
*.rsuser
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# Visual Studio Code
.vscode/

# Rider
.idea/

# NuGet
*.nupkg
# The packages folder can be ignored because of Package Restore
**/packages/

# Dotnet publish
**/publish/

# Azure Functions
.local.settings.json

# Logs
*.log
